          "id": 124,
          "options": {
            "code": {
              "language": "plaintext",
              "showLineNumbers": false,
              "showMiniMap": false
            },
            "content": "# ServiceNow integration\n\n**Ticket creation flow**:  \n1. **ChatOps orchestrator:** Formats ServiceNow payload (gathers alerts, applies mapping) and pushes it into kafka for the snow connector to consume.\n2. **grpc snow connector:** Consumes the snow payload via kafka and makes the api call to ServiceNow. Pushes the response from ServiceNow into kafka.\n3. **ChatOps orchestrator:** Consumes the response via kafka and persists the ServiceNow permalink onto the incident for the UI to display.\n",
            "mode": "markdown"
          },
          "pluginVersion": "12.4.1",
          "title": "",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "description": "The 5 lowest uptimes within the component pods. Pod restarts can impact functionality, review the pod table and uptime graph for more details.",
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "color": {
                "mode": "thresholds"
              },
              "mappings": [],
              "thresholds": {
                "mode": "absolute",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "color": "red",
                    "value": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "#EAB839",
                    "value": 3600
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "super-light-yellow",
                    "value": 43200
                  },
                  {
                    "color": "green",
                    "value": 86400
                  }
                ]
              },
              "unit": "s"
